  "invariants": {
    "status": "present",
    "value": [
      "The native retry callable retries exceptions up to maxAttempts including the first call, invoking an injected delay hook between failed attempts with initialDelay*multiplier^i. Never sleep or perform I/O. The JSON adapter accepts scripted ok/error outcomes and returns value, error, attempts and delays; exhausted scripts raise exhausted.",
